{"product_id":"jason-and-the-golden-fleece","title":"Jason and the Golden Fleece","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBrave Jason comes to claim his throne, but the old king will not give up his rule so easily. To prove his worth, Jason must find the greatest treasure in the world, the Golden Fleece. Jason accepts the challenge, and gathers the fifty greatest heroes of Greece to help him on his quest. Jason and his Argonauts must face rampaging bears, the menacing, flying Harpies, and a six-headed monster flanked by a deadly whirlpool.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Nel Yomtov\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9781406214284\u003cbr\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003ePages: 72\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: 25 x 229\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44730058801305,"sku":"16RB-1-9781406214284","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/81iUUJqqpyS._SL1500.jpg?v=1723104112","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/jason-and-the-golden-fleece","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}